            <content>Legenda:&#xD;
- Yellow: represent the Level 4 enterprise business planning and logistics functions (ISA-95)&#xD;
- Orange: represent additional functions that interact with the Level 4 functions (ISA-95)&#xD;
- Green: represents an enterprise function – Customer Service (this Case Study)&#xD;
</content>
